ps://github.com/lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","login":"lawnjelly","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"Yeah I guess this is fine.\r\nThe `TriangleMesh` is a bit dodgy internally in places but I guess it can be replaced if the API remains the same.\r\n\r\nReturning things from a \"performance\" function in a `Dictionary` is a bit scary, but I guess Godot has form on this. It seems difficult to return multiple values from bound functions efficiently.\r\n\r\nGrok suggested also options:\r\n* Arrays\r\n* Custom Object\r\n* Tuples (new in 4.3)\r\n\r\nBut I guess those could be added in a later bound function. Dictionary does offer some advantages as hedging against changes in what is returned.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#pullrequestreview-2735157350","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104625","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-02T08:24:03Z"}]